  "comments": "Each year different dies.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - large portrait, BARRE to left.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - small portrait, BARRE to right.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - wide script to &quot;20&quot;, horizontal grid behind horse, no grid for ground.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - condensed script to &quot;20&quot;, no grid behind horse, but there is grid for ground.<br /><br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/625c0a186815f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/625c0a186815f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"55\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1998, Ceska Mincova and Budapest Mints.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1999, Maracay mint.",
